{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "data-analysis",
  "title": "资料分析知识框架",
  "root": {
    "id": "root",
    "text": "资料分析\n完整知识框架",
    "side": "center",
    "color": "#2D3038",
    "collapsed": false,
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "quick-calculation",
        "text": "速算技巧",
        "side": "left",
        "color": "#6758E8",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "quick-general",
            "text": "通用类（必修）",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#6758E8",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "estimate-methods",
                "text": "截位直除",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#6758E8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "division-which",
                    "text": "截谁",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "division-one-step",
                        "text": "一步除法\n建议只截分母",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "division-multi-step",
                        "text": "多步计算\n建议上下都截",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "division-digits",
                    "text": "截几位",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "division-two-digits",
                        "text": "选项差距大：截两位\n首位不同；或首位相同、次位差大于首位",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "division-three-digits",
                        "text": "选项差距小：截三位\n首位相同且次位差小于等于首位",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "division-special",
                    "text": "特殊情况",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "division-magnitude",
                        "text": "有效数字相同（如 8.8 与 88）\n截位前先判断答案数量级",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "division-four-digits",
                        "text": "选项前两位甚至前三位相同\n至少截四位（精算）",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "division-difference",
                        "text": "两个分数作差\n差值可能很小，最好截三位",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "multi-add-subtract",
                "text": "多数加减",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#6758E8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "last-digit-method",
                    "text": "尾数法\n精确加减且选项尾数不同\n看最后一位或最后两位",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "high-to-low",
                    "text": "高算低看\n从最高位开始估算\n结合选项及时止损，一般算前两位",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "fraction-comparison",
                "text": "分数比较",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#6758E8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "fraction-one-large-one-small",
                    "text": "一大一小：看分子\n分子大的分数大\n“钱多人少”思维",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "fraction-same-direction",
                    "text": "同大同小",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "fraction-direct-division",
                        "text": "竖着直接除\n注意数量级",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "fraction-multiples",
                        "text": "横着看倍数\n分子倍数大者大；分母倍数大者小",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "fraction-four-options",
                        "text": "倍数不好看就直除\n4 个分数都同大同小时看首位",
                        "side": "left",
                        "color": "#6758E8",
                        "collapsed": false,
                        "children": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "quick-advanced",
            "text": "拔高类（选修）",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#6758E8",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "proportional-scaling",
                "text": "等比例收缩",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#6758E8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "scaling-meaning",
                    "text": "最精确的速算技巧\n但操作难度较高",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "scaling-when",
                    "text": "理论上所有除法都可用\n差距大用截两位或估算\n差距小的一步除法常截三位",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "scaling-base-near-one",
                    "text": "分母接近 1 的基期量\n观察分子分母倍数，同加减\n把分母变成 1（或 100）",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "scaling-close-denominators",
                    "text": "两个相近分母的除法加减\n作差得差分数，再同加减\n把分母变成相同",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "scaling-base-ratio",
                    "text": "基期比例选项差距小\n分析不能唯一确定时\n观察倍数，把后面部分约掉",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "difference-method",
                "text": "差分法",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#6758E8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "difference-method-when",
                    "text": "同大同小\n且两个分子、分母都非常接近",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "difference-method-how",
                    "text": "分子、分母分别作差得差分数\n用差分数代替分子大的分数\n与分子小的分数比较",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#6758E8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "base-current",
        "text": "基期与现期",
        "side": "right",
        "color": "#10A793",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "base-current-symbols",
            "text": "符号说明\n$A$：现期量，$B$：基期量\n$r$：增长率，$\\Delta$：增长量",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#10A793",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "base-period",
            "text": "基期量",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#10A793",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "base-period-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n求以前某个时期的量",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-period-formulas",
                "text": "核心公式",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "base-from-growth-amount",
                    "text": "$$B=A-\\Delta$$",
                    "side": "right",
                    "color": "#10A793",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "base-from-rate",
                    "text": "$$B=\\frac{A}{1+r}$$",
                    "side": "right",
                    "color": "#10A793",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "base-from-delta-rate",
                    "text": "$$B=\\frac{\\Delta}{r}$$",
                    "side": "right",
                    "color": "#10A793",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "base-period-speed",
                "text": "速算\n截位直除；当 $|r|<5\\%$\n$\\frac{A}{1+r}\\approx A(1-r)$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-period-sum-difference",
                "text": "基期和差\n先用现期量和正负排除\n再计算，算一步看一步",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-period-comparison",
                "text": "基期比较",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "base-comparison-current-large",
                    "text": "现期量差距大且 $r$ 小\n现期量大者，基期量通常更大",
                    "side": "right",
                    "color": "#10A793",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "base-comparison-current-close",
                    "text": "现期量相同或接近\n用分数比较法\n增长率小者基期量更大",
                    "side": "right",
                    "color": "#10A793",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "current-period",
            "text": "现期量",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#10A793",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "current-period-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n求未来某个时期的量",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "current-period-formulas",
                "text": "核心公式\n$A=B+\\Delta$\n$A=B(1+r)$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "current-period-speed",
                "text": "速算\n乘法拆开算；未给 $r$ 且两期接近时\n用增长量估算，选略大的结果",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "current-period-question",
                "text": "注意问法\n保持增量不变\n还是保持增速不变",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#10A793",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "growth",
        "text": "一般增长率",
        "side": "left",
        "color": "#2F80ED",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "growth-rate",
            "text": "增长率计算",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#2F80ED",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "growth-rate-current",
                "text": "识别\n增速、增幅、增长率\n增长/下降 + 比例（%、几成、倍）",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-rate-points",
                "text": "考法一：给百分点\n高减低加",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-rate-two-known",
                "text": "考法二\n现期量、基期量、增长量\n任给两个求增长率",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-rate-threshold",
                "text": "考法三\n判断超过 10%（20%、50%、100%）\n的有几个",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-rate-formula",
                "text": "$$r=\\frac{\\Delta}{B}=\\frac{A-B}{B}=\\frac{\\Delta}{A-\\Delta}$$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-rate-denominator",
                "text": "注意\n计算增长率时\n分母一定是基期量",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "growth-rate-comparison",
            "text": "增长率比较",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#2F80ED",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "growth-comparison-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n增长率排序\n增长 + 快/慢",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-comparison-base-current",
                "text": "已知现期量和基期量\n先看 $A/B$ 的倍数\n看不出再用 $\\Delta/B$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-comparison-current-delta",
                "text": "已知现期量和增长量\n只比较时可直接看\n$\\Delta/A$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#2F80ED",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "growth-amount",
        "text": "增长量",
        "side": "right",
        "color": "#E58A2D",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "growth-amount-calculate",
            "text": "增长量计算",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#E58A2D",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n增长量为多少\n增长 + 单位（如亿元）",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-difference",
                "text": "已知现期量和基期量\n$$\\Delta=A-B$$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-formula",
                "text": "已知现期量和 $r$（重点）\n$$\\Delta=Br=\\frac{A}{1+r}r$$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-methods",
                "text": "百分数化分数\n近似转化、倍数转化\n取中转化、公式法",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-fraction",
                "text": "当 $|r|=\\frac{1}{N}$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "growth-amount-positive",
                    "text": "$r>0$：$$\\Delta=\\frac{A}{N+1}$$",
                    "side": "right",
                    "color": "#E58A2D",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "growth-amount-negative",
                    "text": "$r<0$：$$\\Delta=-\\frac{A}{N-1}$$",
                    "side": "right",
                    "color": "#E58A2D",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "growth-amount-comparison",
            "text": "增长量比较",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#E58A2D",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-comparison-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n增长量排序\n增长 + 多少",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-known-base",
                "text": "已知现期量和基期量\n直接作差\n柱形图看高度差",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-known-rate",
                "text": "已知现期量和 $r$\n大大则大；一大一小看倍数\n（百分点）",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-close-multiples",
                "text": "$r$ 的倍数略大于现期量倍数时\n建议百分数化分数",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "growth-amount-signs",
                "text": "同为正：比增长量；同为负：比减少量\n一正一负：增长量正数大于负数\n比较变化量时用百分点计算",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E58A2D",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "proportion",
        "text": "比重",
        "side": "left",
        "color": "#D65780",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "current-proportion",
            "text": "现期比重",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#D65780",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "current-proportion-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n求今年，题干或材料有“占比”",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "current-proportion-amount",
                "text": "比重三式\n$比重=\\frac{部分}{整体}$\n$整体=\\frac{部分}{比重}$；$部分=整体\\times 比重$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-special-concepts",
                "text": "特殊概念\n$利润率=\\frac{利润}{收入}$\n$增长贡献率=\\frac{部分增长量}{整体增长量}$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-transfer",
                "text": "比重传递\n已知 A 占 B、B 占 C\n求 A 占 C",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-ratio",
                "text": "比重比例\n已知 A 占整体比重\n求 B 占整体比重",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-pie-chart",
                "text": "饼状图：12 点原则\n看大小、看特殊占比\n重点关注四分之一",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-speed",
                "text": "速算\n除法截位直除\n乘法拆分凑整",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "base-proportion",
            "text": "基期比重",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#D65780",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "base-proportion-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n求去年的占比",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-proportion-formula",
                "text": "$$\\frac{A/(1+a)}{B/(1+b)}=\\frac{A}{B}\\times\\frac{1+b}{1+a}$$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-proportion-analysis",
                "text": "分析思维\n先算左边现期比重\n观察右边与 1 的关系，结合选项定范围",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-proportion-calculate",
                "text": "计算思维\n差距大：上下截两位约分\n差距小且分析不出：等比例放缩",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "proportion-change",
            "text": "两期比重",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#D65780",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "proportion-change-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n两个时间、一个比重",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-change-value",
                "text": "$$两期比重差=\\frac{A}{B}\\times\\frac{a-b}{1+a}$$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-change-direction",
                "text": "判断升降\n$a>b$：上升\n$a<b$：下降",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "proportion-change-points",
                "text": "求上升/下降多少个百分点\n先判升降；再选小于增速之差的结果\n不能锁定范围时，代公式估算",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#D65780",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "average",
        "text": "平均数",
        "side": "right",
        "color": "#7A62C7",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "current-average",
            "text": "现期平均数",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#7A62C7",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "current-average-formula",
                "text": "$平均数=\\frac{总数}{份数}$\n口诀：后面除以前面",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "current-average-speed",
                "text": "速算\n截位直除\n削峰填谷",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "base-average",
            "text": "基期平均数",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#7A62C7",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "base-average-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n求去年，题干中有“平均”",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-average-formula",
                "text": "$$\\frac{A/(1+a)}{B/(1+b)}=\\frac{A}{B}\\times\\frac{1+b}{1+a}$$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-average-thinking",
                "text": "分析与计算\n同基期比重\n先定范围，再截位或等比例放缩",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "average-growth",
            "text": "两期平均数",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#7A62C7",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "average-growth-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n两个时间、一个平均",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "average-growth-direction",
                "text": "平均数比去年升降\n$a>b$：上升；$a<b$：下降\n$a=b$：不变",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "average-growth-amount-recognition",
                "text": "问“平均数 + 增长 + 单位”\n识别为平均数增长量",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "average-growth-rate",
                "text": "问“平均数增长 + %”\n先找分子增速 $a$ 与分母增速 $b$\n$$r_{平均}=\\frac{a-b}{1+b}$$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#7A62C7",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "multiple",
        "text": "倍数",
        "side": "left",
        "color": "#17A673",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "multiple-basic",
            "text": "现期倍数",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#17A673",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "current-multiple-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n求今年，题干中有“倍数”",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "current-multiple-formula",
                "text": "公式：前面除以后面\n速算：截位直除",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "multiple-is",
                "text": "“是几倍”\n直接相除",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "multiple-more",
                "text": "“多/高/增长几倍”\n相除后减 1",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "multiple-exceed",
                "text": "“超过 N 倍”\n表示大于 N 倍",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "base-multiple",
            "text": "基期倍数",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#17A673",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "base-multiple-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n求去年 A 是 B 的多少倍",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-multiple-formula",
                "text": "$$\\frac{A/(1+a)}{B/(1+b)}=\\frac{A}{B}\\times\\frac{1+b}{1+a}$$",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "base-multiple-thinking",
                "text": "分析与计算\n同基期比重\n先定范围，再截位或等比例放缩",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#17A673",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "interval-growth",
        "text": "间隔问题",
        "side": "right",
        "color": "#E06C75",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "growth-rate-interval",
            "text": "识别\n时间上隔一期",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#E06C75",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "interval-rate",
            "text": "求间隔增长率\n$$r_{间隔}=r_1+r_2+r_1r_2$$",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#E06C75",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "interval-rate-speed",
                "text": "先看 $r_1+r_2$ 能否排除\n不能排除时再估算乘积",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#E06C75",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "interval-base",
            "text": "求间隔基期量\n$$B_{间隔}=\\frac{A}{1+r_{间隔}}$$\n先算间隔增长率，再直除",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#E06C75",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "interval-multiple",
            "text": "求间隔倍数\n$$倍数=r_{间隔}+1$$",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#E06C75",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "interval-amount",
            "text": "求间隔增长量（极少）\n先算间隔增长率\n再用百分数化分数的增长量公式",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#E06C75",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "mixed-growth",
        "text": "混合增长率",
        "side": "left",
        "color": "#5563B8",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "mixed-growth-recognition",
            "text": "识别\n求增长率但缺少数据\n主体之间存在和差关系",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#5563B8",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "mixed-growth-rule",
            "text": "口诀\n混合之后整体居中\n偏向基期量大的",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#5563B8",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "mixed-growth-relations",
            "text": "常见和差关系",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#5563B8",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "mixed-time",
                "text": "时间型\n1—5 月 + 6 月 = 1—6 月\n一季度 + 二季度 = 上半年",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#5563B8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "mixed-pairing",
                "text": "搭配型\n进口+出口=进出口；城镇+农村=全国\n邮政+电信=邮电；本币+外币=本外币",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#5563B8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "mixed-logic",
                "text": "逻辑型\nA + 非 A = 总体\n如实物 + 非实物 = 所有商品",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#5563B8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "mixed-growth-special",
            "text": "特殊考法",
            "side": "left",
            "color": "#5563B8",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "mixed-difference-rate",
                "text": "求一个差的增长率\n先移项变成和\n再用混合增长率口诀",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#5563B8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "mixed-part-overall",
                "text": "比较部分增速与整体增速",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#5563B8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "mixed-cumulative-up",
                    "text": "累计增速上升\n当期 $r>$ 累计 $r$",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#5563B8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "mixed-cumulative-down",
                    "text": "累计增速下降\n当期 $r<$ 累计 $r$",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#5563B8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "mixed-cumulative-flat",
                    "text": "累计增速不变\n当期 $r=$ 累计 $r$",
                    "side": "left",
                    "color": "#5563B8",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "mixed-line-method",
                "text": "线段法\n距离和量成反比\n口诀不能解题或已知 $r$ 求两部分量之比时用",
                "side": "left",
                "color": "#5563B8",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "annual-average-growth",
        "text": "年均增长类",
        "side": "right",
        "color": "#B7791F",
        "collapsed": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "annual-average-amount",
            "text": "年均增长量",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#B7791F",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "annual-average-amount-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n年均增长 + 单位（如元）",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "annual-average-amount-formula",
                "text": "$$年均增长量=\\frac{现期量-基期量}{年份差}$$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "annual-average-rate",
            "text": "年均增长率",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#B7791F",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "annual-average-rate-recognition",
                "text": "识别\n年均增长最快、年均增速排序",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "annual-average-rate-formula",
                "text": "$$(1+r)^n=\\frac{现期量}{基期量}$$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "annual-average-rate-comparison",
                "text": "比较方法\n$n$ 相同时\n比较 $现期量/基期量$",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "annual-average-rate-note",
                "text": "年均增长率计算\n属于冷门考点",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "annual-average-years",
            "text": "年份规则",
            "side": "right",
            "color": "#B7791F",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "annual-years-normal",
                "text": "常规：A 年至 B 年\nA 为基期，B 为现期\n年份差 = B − A",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "annual-years-plan",
                "text": "“十三五”\n2015 年为基期，2020 年为现期\n年份差为 5",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "annual-years-jiangsu",
                "text": "江苏省考/事业单位\n基期一律前推",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "annual-years-specific",
                "text": "“2012—2014 这三年”\n2011 为基期，2014 为现期，年份差 3\n旧时硬性规则，现在较少考",
                "side": "right",
                "color": "#B7791F",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
